Subject: [PATCH 08/51] Plutonium: import browser tabs from other shells into a
 thread

The Apps panel's Elsewhere list includes browser tabs in no T3 thread.
Opening one tags it with the thread and has a new browser panel tab show
it; closing that panel tab takes the tag off instead of closing the tab.
A preview re-created once the server's epoch is known keeps its tab, and
an imported tab whose preview closes waits 2 s to be taken back.

